Subject: Select original scrolling camera overlay with explicit native camera input
Upstream-base: 0f5a757947b8778b680d4d1ae7e6df1792a514f2

Retain the original position-generated overlay coordinates, four-stage TEV,
lighting, shadows, UV1 diffuse input and diffuse-wrap mutation order. Preserve
the matching renderer's address-based mask-scroll condition; reject zero scale
in the native loader because this variant has no zero-scale fallback. Supply an explicit active
camera position without selecting or replacing the original camera manager.
Use bounded float arrays, typed FIFO calls, checked finite texture matrices and
registry teardown. Console camera, vertex formats and FIFO access remain intact.

